2026-11-27T04:19:18.0906823Z /* Progressive job pipeline (product/query_app.py): the map appears after one
2026-11-27T04:19:18.0907396Z    upstream page, the wider retrieval is expanded in the background, and the
2026-11-27T04:19:18.0908041Z    sourced answer + counter-authority pass run last.  Each stage is a server-side
2026-11-27T04:19:18.0908445Z    job, so nothing here ever blocks on a multi-minute request; a page reload can
