2026-11-27T04:22:50.5965374Z 
2026-11-27T04:22:50.5965378Z 
2026-11-27T04:22:50.5965657Z def _start_job(run_id: str, name: str, fn, detail: dict | None = None) -> tuple[dict, bool]:
2026-11-27T04:22:50.5966293Z     """Start ``fn`` unless that job is already running. Returns (job, started)."""
2026-11-27T04:22:50.5966713Z     with RUNS_LOCK:
