2026-11-27T04:30:50.6122020Z #!/usr/bin/env node
2026-11-27T04:30:50.6122478Z /* Offline DOM verification for product/static/query.html.
2026-11-27T04:30:50.6122872Z  *
2026-11-27T04:30:50.6123251Z  /*   node product/verify_query_page.js BUNDLE.json [DEEP_LINK_SEARCH] [HTML_PATH]
2026-11-27T04:30:50.6123727Z  *
2026-11-27T04:30:50.6123934Z  * Why this exists
2026-11-27T04:30:50.6124181Z  * ---------------
2026-11-27T04:30:50.6124581Z  * The accepted human-gate switch is adopted byte-identically and wired into the
2026-11-27T04:30:50.6125188Z  * product page.  Hook-string assertions prove the wiring text exists; this
2026-11-27T04:30:50.6125765Z  * script executes the real page scripts in a minimal DOM and proves the
2026-11-27T04:30:50.6126130Z  * behaviour that the owner gate depends on:
2026-11-27T04:30:50.6126344Z  *
2026-11-27T04:30:50.6126560Z  *   1. the page boots and mounts the toggle into the existing #toolbar;
2026-11-27T04:30:50.6126924Z  *   2. rendering a real query_result_bundle fills the baseline list with one row
2026-11-27T04:30:50.6127261Z  *      per decision (same bundle, no second retrieval);
2026-11-27T04:30:50.6127553Z  *   3. no network call is made by the page boot or by a view switch;
2026-11-27T04:30:50.6128109Z  *   4. toggling to the list hides the map, shows the list, and the product's own
2026-11-27T04:30:50.6128466Z  *      status (phase pill / counts) survives the harness writing #status.
2026-11-27T04:30:50.6128917Z  *   5. a deep link (?run_id=… / ?q=&n=) selects which run or question the page
2026-11-27T04:30:50.6129303Z  *      opens - the multi-question gate packet hands the owner one link per
